{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong> is a psychological survival horror game where the forest watches you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Thalarius</strong>, a paranormal investigator drawn into the cursed Black Forest \u2014 a place where reality fractures, voices whisper lies, and fear is a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What begins as an investigation quickly becomes a fight to survive an environment that twists perception, drains sanity, and punishes every mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the forest, manage scarce resources, and uncover the truth before fear and madness consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This game is currently in Early Access. Content and features will continue to be expanded throughout development.</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>CURRENT FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One playable chapter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Core exploration gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Several paranormal encounters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Two endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Approximately 20\u201330 minutes of gameplay<strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong> </strong><br><strong>PLANNED FEATURES </strong><br><strong> </strong><br>Full story across <strong>four chapters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expanded forest areas and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Improved survival and sanity mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Additional paranormal encounters and hallucinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More endings and player choices</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039020?t=1769176772","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039020?t=1769176772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039020/0e64b9dd1b4187e722a6f7041d7e2846ed929276/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769176772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039020/0e64b9dd1b4187e722a6f7041d7e2846ed929276/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769176772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLIST</strong> is a psychological survival horror game where the forest watches you back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as <strong>Thalarius</strong>, a paranormal investigator drawn into the cursed Black Forest \u2014 a place where reality fractures, voices whisper lies, and fear is a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What begins as an investigation quickly becomes a fight to survive an environment that twists perception, drains sanity, and punishes every mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore the forest, manage scarce resources, and uncover the truth before fear and madness consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" s